1
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:22,589
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 14=

4
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:49,920
I made you my dog back then.

5
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:52,799
And I can do the same now.

6
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,960
What are you waiting for?

7
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:59,000
Beat him to death!

8
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:21,760
(What a shame.)

9
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,719
(You never got to know)

10
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:25,799
(that you would die by my hand.)

11
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,439
Beat him to death!

12
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:31,480
Break his legs!

13
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,040
Haotian!

14
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:32,680
No!

15
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,439
His ears!

16
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,120
Cut off his ears!

17
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,159
It's you.

18
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,120
(Haotian, you're back.)

19
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:05,879
(You love fish, don't you?)

20
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,840
(I bought some for you today.)

21
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,159
(And your favorite meat, too.)

22
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,120
(Today,)

23
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,120
(I'll make braised pork for you.)

24
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,120
(I even bought fresh fish today.)

25
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,319
(You're going to love it.)

26
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,719
(I learned the recipe online.)

27
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:21,960
(What's wrong?)

28
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:32,719
(Haotian.)

29
00:03:41,639 --> 00:03:42,400
(What's wrong?)

30
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:43,240
(Three.)

31
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:48,960
(Two.)

32
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:52,919
(One.)

33
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:57,240
(Run!)

34
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,919
(Zhang Haotian!)

35
00:04:04,719 --> 00:04:05,639
(Zhang Haotian!)

36
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,560
(What kind of dump is this?)

37
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,520
(Is this even fit for people
to live in?)

38
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,680
(Zhang Haotian, get out here!)

39
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,879
(There's another match this afternoon.)

40
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,839
(This time, you will compete
with a German shepherd dog.)

41
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,480
(Be there on time.)

42
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,800
(What the hell?)

43
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:39,040
(What are you waiting for?)

44
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,160
(Kill him!)

45
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,759
(Kill her!)

46
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,000
You're still alive?

47
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,600
I thought you'd turn to ashes by now.

48
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,240
If someone hadn't called the police,

49
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,319
I really would turn to ashes.

50
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,800
You plotted this all along,

51
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,480
and went to such lengths
to lure Chen Ping into a trap...

52
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,560
It was all to get revenge on me.

53
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,120
The deeper the love,

54
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,519
the deeper the hatred.

55
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,240
Zhao Mai.

56
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,839
How much did you love me?

57
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,639
Yes.

58
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,199
I loved you once.

59
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,240
I gave you everything I had.

60
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,399
Everything I did for you...

61
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,480
I don't regret it.

62
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:21,279
No? Then why did you find Wang
to take revenge on me?

63
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,240
Zhang Haotian.

64
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,560
For these ten years,

65
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,519
I've told myself countless times

66
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:33,360
to let you go,

67
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,639
and to let myself go.

68
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,720
But I couldn't.

69
00:06:39,879 --> 00:06:41,639
Every time I close my eyes,

70
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:43,720
I see the look in your eyes
before you left.

71
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,439
I have always treated people sincerely.

72
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,319
But you

73
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,120
made me question who I was.

74
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,560
When you gave me your love,

75
00:06:59,639 --> 00:07:01,920
did you ever ask if I wanted it?

76
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:05,680
What you gave me was never
what I wanted.

77
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,680
I was like

78
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,720
a dog trapped in a cage by all of you.

79
00:07:09,075 --> 00:07:11,693
♪That burns you like the cold♪

80
00:07:12,136 --> 00:07:15,581
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

81
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:18,120
I want you to repay

82
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:21,279
all the pain you caused me back then.

83
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,360
Zhang Haotian.

84
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:33,920
I grew up in an orphanage.

85
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:35,920
But you

86
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:39,240
were worse off than an orphan.

87
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:43,680
You grew up enduring people's
contempt and humiliation.

88
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:45,759
You had enough of being poor.

89
00:07:45,759 --> 00:07:46,959
You were terrified of being poor again.

90
00:07:49,725 --> 00:07:51,968
♪Caught in the madness♪

91
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,759
Back then,

92
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:58,720
you were played like a dog.

93
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,839
Wasn't it all just for money?

94
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,480
For money,

95
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,319
what's wrong with acting like a dog?

96
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,040
I didn't care.

97
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,120
Is this your last desperate struggle?

98
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,480
If thinking this way makes you
feel better,

99
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,639
then keep believing it.

100
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,240
I'm going to save Chen Ping.

101
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,480
I'm going to save him.

102
00:08:36,114 --> 00:08:40,655
♪Ain't no fire, fire♪

103
00:08:59,295 --> 00:09:01,323
(A Dog)

104
00:09:01,851 --> 00:09:05,949
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

105
00:09:06,757 --> 00:09:09,569
♪I should forget you♪

106
00:09:10,038 --> 00:09:15,115
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

107
00:09:15,139 --> 00:09:16,979
♪To carry on♪

108
00:09:17,235 --> 00:09:22,092
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

109
00:09:22,458 --> 00:09:24,346
♪You no longer have the strength♪

110
00:09:26,645 --> 00:09:29,526
♪You want me to go there for you♪

111
00:09:31,094 --> 00:09:36,532
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

112
00:09:37,126 --> 00:09:40,265
♪Your freedom♪

113
00:09:40,965 --> 00:09:45,396
♪Has become my cage♪

114
00:09:46,324 --> 00:09:52,115
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

115
00:09:53,466 --> 00:09:59,316
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

116
00:09:59,779 --> 00:10:05,726
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

117
00:10:06,006 --> 00:10:09,256
♪You told me♪

118
00:10:09,653 --> 00:10:14,159
♪I would shine like a star♪

119
00:10:15,003 --> 00:10:19,300
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

120
00:10:19,300 --> 00:10:23,200
♪How to live without you♪

121
00:10:23,419 --> 00:10:29,244
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

122
00:10:30,765 --> 00:10:34,549
♪So hazy and blurred♪
